  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Fondo Unico per l&apos;Assistenza Tecnica ai Programmi di Cooperazione in Iraq</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance Fund for Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">L&apos;iniziativa mira a fornire le risorse necessarie all&apos;ufficio dell&apos;agenzia ad Amman per monitorare, supervisionare e pianificare attivit&#xe0; di sviluppo e cooperazione in Iraq.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative aims at providing the needed resources to the Agency Office in Amman to monitor, supervise as well as plan Development and Cooperation activities in Iraq.</narrative>
  </description>
